  (text "SEPARATE LEG / UPPER-BODY SWITCHES / source is regulated motor bus"
    (at 15 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "26aa348d-d6d5-5bf8-81a4-998a7319c79f")
  )
  (text "Paired Si7149DP P-channel devices provide a low-resistance high-side switch per group.\nTheir body diodes allow returned energy back toward the common motor rail. That energy still needs an absorber.\nFuse ratings, harness leaf protection, inrush SOA and regeneration are not qualified; do not connect motors yet."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "16521248-c663-5acc-b12f-51b689005171")
  )
